WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.000
GymNative gives your members practical workout support in an app that feels part of your gym.

00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:11.000
Members can lose track of exercise settings, previous weights and where to start.

00:00:11.000 --> 00:00:17.000
Your branded web app puts that support on their phone, using your equipment and exercises.

00:00:17.000 --> 00:00:22.000
They can follow their routine and save each set as they train.

00:00:22.000 --> 00:00:27.000
The charts then help them understand how their training is progressing.

00:00:27.000 --> 00:00:31.000
This gives their next coaching conversation useful context.

00:00:31.000 --> 00:00:38.500
We build, host and update the app, while you introduce it to members with the poster.

00:00:38.500 --> 00:00:43.266
With GymNative, your gym can offer members a useful extra service.

00:00:43.266 --> 00:00:45.000
Let’s explore a pilot.
